IDEPLUS - IDE2.0PLUS support››The IDE2.0PLUS (IDE Plus 2.0) is a PBI›hard disk interface. Its BIOS maps APT›partitions to drives D1:-D15:; EOS›reaches them through the OS's SIO like›any other drive.››Verified in Altirra:›- EOS starts and warm-resets with the›device.›- BIOS21.COM, the BIOS 2.1 updater,›runs under EOS and flashes the device.›- With BIOS 2.1, EOS reads the›physical disk (device $20, also by›XDCB), uses a mapped partition›(status, PERCOM, DISKINFO, DIR, TYPE,›COPY) and reads it again after a warm›reset.›- APT lists and changes the partition›table; the BIOS uses the new mapping›after a restart.››Setup: map partitions with APT,›restart, then FORMAT the drive. To›update the BIOS, run BIOS21.COM from›the KMK/DLT distribution and answer›its questions.››Not verified: real hardware, the slave›disk, the BIOS's ATR mounting and SDX›cartridge switching.››See also: APT, FORMAT›